# CODEOWNERS — separated review ownership (P0-2).
#
# P0-2 requires review ownership to be separate from authorship: at least one
# author-distinct reviewer, with a named security reviewer and a named
# numerical/scientific reviewer.
#
# The handles below are intentionally UNFILLED. Assigning the repository author
# here would satisfy the file but not the requirement, so
# `build_independent_review_evidence_gate.py` reports `*_unassigned` /
# `*_only_author` until real non-author handles are recorded.
#
# Replace each OPERATOR_FILL_* token with a GitHub handle or team, then run:
#   python3 tools/product/build_independent_review_evidence_gate.py

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
*                                       OPERATOR_FILL_DEFAULT_REVIEWER

